## **5. URL Encoding Cheatsheet**

| Character | Encoded |
| --------- | ------- |
| `=`       | `%3D`   |
| `/`       | `%2F`   |
| `:`       | `%3A`   |
| `?`       | `%3F`   |
| `@`       | `%40`   |
| `\`       | `%5C`   |

**Remember:**

- `%3Dhttp` → parameter containing `=http`
- `%3Dhttps` → parameter containing `=https`
- `%3D%2F` → parameter containing `=/`

